OL,3,GNEWSAAudio guides for blind come to
OL,4,Arailway stations
OL,5,
OL,6,FAudio guides for blind and partially
OL,7,Fsighted people have come to six railway
OL,8,Fstations, including two in Sussex.
OL,10,FThe guides help passengers familiarise
OL,11,Fthemselves with station and train
OL,12,Flayouts before they travel.
OL,14,FThey have been introduced at Brighton,
OL,15,FEastbourne, as well as London
OL,16,FBlackfriars, Sutton, Stevenage and
OL,17,FLuton Parkway.
OL,19,FThe scheme has been introduced by Sight
OL,20,FLoss Council volunteers and staff at
OL,21,FGreater Thameslink Railway (GTR).
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
